    <script type="application/ld+json"> {
    "@context": "https://schema.org",
    "@type": "NewsArticle",
    "headline": "YEN\u0130 Parti\u0027de sand\u0131k heyecan\u0131! \u00dcnver ve Evcen oyunu kulland\u0131",
    "name": "YEN\u0130 Parti\u0027de sand\u0131k heyecan\u0131! \u00dcnver ve Evcen oyunu kulland\u0131",
    "inLanguage": "tr",
    "mainEntityOfPage": {
        "@type": "WebPage",
        "@id": "https://www.karamangundem.com/yeni-partide-sandik-heyecani-unver-ve-evcen-oyunu-kullandi/471998"
    },
    "publisher": {
        "@type": "NewsMediaOrganization",
        "name": "Karaman G\u00fcndem",
        "logo": {
            "@type": "ImageObject",
            "url": "https://www.karamangundem.com/images/generals/logo.png",
            "width": 240,
            "height": 60
        }
    },
    "datePublished": "2026-11-08T13:27:46+03:00",
    "dateModified": "2026-11-08T13:27:46+03:00",
    "description": "YEN\u0130 Parti Karaman Milletvekili \u0130smail Atakan \u00dcnver ve \u0130l Ba\u015fkan\u0131 Ahmet Recai Evcen, genel ba\u015fkanl\u0131k \u00f6n se\u00e7iminde oy kullanarak parti i\u00e7i demokrasi mesaj\u0131 verdi.",
    "articleBody": "YEN\u0130 Parti\u0027de genel ba\u015fkanl\u0131k \u00f6n se\u00e7imi heyecan\u0131 Karaman\u0027da da ya\u015fan\u0131yor. Karaman Milletvekili \u0130smail Atakan \u00dcnver ile \u0130l Ba\u015fkan\u0131 Ahmet Recai Evcen, 8 Kas\u0131m Pazar g\u00fcn\u00fc \u0130l Ba\u015fkanl\u0131\u011f\u0131nda kurulan sand\u0131kta oylar\u0131n\u0131 kulland\u0131. Her iki isim de \u00fcyelerin karar s\u00fcre\u00e7lerine do\u011frudan kat\u0131l\u0131m\u0131na dikkat \u00e7ekti.\r\n\r\nT\u00fcrkiye genelinde 81 ilde yakla\u015f\u0131k 3 bin sand\u0131kta ger\u00e7ekle\u015ftirilen \u00f6n se\u00e7imde mevcut Genel Ba\u015fkan \u00d6zg\u00fcr \u00d6zel tek aday olarak yer al\u0131yor. Oy verme i\u015flemleri saat 09.00\u0027da ba\u015flarken sand\u0131klar\u0131n 17.00\u0027de kapanmas\u0131 planlan\u0131yor.\u00a0\r\n\r\n\u00dcNVER: \u201cVATANDA\u015eIN VE \u00dcYEN\u0130N SES\u0130N\u0130N DUYULDU\u011eU B\u0130R S\u0130YASET\u201d\r\n\r\nKaraman \u0130l Ba\u015fkanl\u0131\u011f\u0131nda oyunu kullanan Milletvekili \u0130smail Atakan \u00dcnver, parti y\u00f6netiminde \u00fcyelerin s\u00f6z sahibi olmas\u0131n\u0131n \u00f6nemini vurgulad\u0131.\r\n\r\n\u00dcnver, a\u00e7\u0131klamas\u0131nda \u015fu ifadeleri kulland\u0131:\r\n\r\n\u201cGenel Ba\u015fkanl\u0131k \u00d6nse\u00e7imi i\u00e7in \u0130l Ba\u015fkanl\u0131\u011f\u0131m\u0131zda oyumuzu kulland\u0131k. YEN\u0130 Parti olarak vatanda\u015f\u0131n/\u00fcyenin sesinin duyuldu\u011fu ve al\u0131nacak kararlarda yetki sahibi oldu\u011fu bir siyaseti ad\u0131m ad\u0131m in\u015fa ediyoruz/edece\u011fiz.\u201d\r\n\r\nEVCEN\u0027DEN \u00dcYELERE SANDIK \u00c7A\u011eRISI\r\n\r\nYEN\u0130 Parti Karaman \u0130l Ba\u015fkan\u0131 Ahmet Recai Evcen de oyunu kullanarak parti \u00fcyelerini se\u00e7ime kat\u0131lmaya davet etti.\r\n\r\nEvcen, yapt\u0131\u011f\u0131 a\u00e7\u0131klamada \u015fu s\u00f6zlere yer verdi:\r\n\r\n\u201cYeni Parti Genel ba\u015fkanl\u0131k \u00f6n se\u00e7iminde oyumuzu kulland\u0131k. Demokrasinin ve \u00fcyelerimizin iradesinin en g\u00fc\u00e7l\u00fc \u015fekilde yans\u0131d\u0131\u011f\u0131 bu \u00f6nemli se\u00e7imde t\u00fcm \u00fcyelerimizi oy kullanmaya davet ediyoruz. Demokrasiye, de\u011fi\u015fime ve gelece\u011fimize birlikte sahip \u00e7\u0131kal\u0131m!\u201d\r\n\r\nGENEL BA\u015eKANI BEL\u0130RLEME S\u00dcREC\u0130NDE \u00dcYELER S\u00d6Z SAH\u0130B\u0130\r\n\r\nYEN\u0130 Parti\u0027nin 14-15 Kas\u0131m tarihlerinde Ankara\u0027da ger\u00e7ekle\u015ftirece\u011fi 1. Ola\u011fan Kurultay \u00f6ncesinde d\u00fczenlenen \u00f6n se\u00e7imde, 5 Kas\u0131m\u0027a kadar partiye \u00fcye olanlara oy kullanma hakk\u0131 tan\u0131nd\u0131.\r\n\r\n\u0130l\u00e7e ve il ba\u015fkanl\u0131klar\u0131 i\u00e7in yap\u0131lan \u00f6n se\u00e7imlerin ard\u0131ndan genel ba\u015fkanl\u0131k s\u00fcrecinde de \u00fcyelerin g\u00f6r\u00fc\u015flerine ba\u015fvuruluyor.\u00a0\r\n\r\n\u00d6ZG\u00dcR \u00d6ZEL\u0027DEN 250 B\u0130N K\u0130\u015e\u0130L\u0130K KAMPANYA PLANI\r\n\r\nYEN\u0130 Parti Genel Ba\u015fkan\u0131 \u00d6zg\u00fcr \u00d6zel de Ankara \u0130l Ba\u015fkanl\u0131\u011f\u0131nda oyunu kulland\u0131.\r\n\r\n\u00d6zel, \u00f6n se\u00e7im kapsam\u0131nda yapt\u0131\u011f\u0131 a\u00e7\u0131klamada gelecek se\u00e7imler i\u00e7in 250 bin ki\u015filik bir saha \u00f6rg\u00fctlenmesi olu\u015fturmay\u0131 hedeflediklerini belirtti. Parti \u00fcyelerinin yan\u0131 s\u0131ra g\u00f6n\u00fcll\u00fclerin de kat\u0131labilece\u011fi \u00e7al\u0131\u015fmalarla se\u00e7menlere do\u011frudan ula\u015fmay\u0131 planlad\u0131klar\u0131n\u0131 s\u00f6yledi.\u00a0\r\n\r\nYEN\u0130 Parti\u0027de genel ba\u015fkanl\u0131k \u00f6n se\u00e7iminin ard\u0131ndan g\u00f6zler 14-15 Kas\u0131m tarihlerinde Ankara\u0027da ger\u00e7ekle\u015ftirilecek ola\u011fan kurultaya \u00e7evrilecek.",
    "articleSection": "S\u0130YASET",
    "wordCount": 302,
    "genre": "news",
    "isFamilyFriendly": true,
